  "bodyHash": "I5Sv8GnPKx8=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/blinkload/raw/037750184f8b2a5ecfa7ed0403410e73061b1fa7/docs/assets/icon/icon_128x128.png\" alt=\"BlinkLoad 圖示\"></p><h1>BlinkLoad</h1><p>Minecraft 模組，可快取資源以減少遊戲載入時間。</p><h2>效能測試</h2><h3>規格</h3><ul>\n<li>CPU：Intel i7-9750H @ 3.1GHz</li>\n<li>16GB RAM @ 2667MHz</li>\n</ul><h3>模組</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n</ul><h3>結果</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/blinkload/raw/7460f26fee6bb445d3841e83b022e9c42596ad27/docs/benchmarks/benchmark.png\" alt=\"效能圖表\"></p><p>結果可能因硬體而異（例如：較快的硬體可能受益較少）。</p><h2>依賴</h2><h3>必要</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n</ul><h2>相容性資訊</h2><h3>相容模組</h3><p>BlinkLoad 應與 Modrinth/CurseForge 上 Minecraft <code>1.20.x</code> 版本的大部分（若非全部）熱門最佳化模組相容。</p><h3>不相容</h3><p>請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/blinkload/issues?q=is:issue is:open sort:updated-desc label:compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>以了解不相容的清單。</p><h2>下載</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/blinkload\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblinkload\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blinkload\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/compact/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/compact/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/compact/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/blinkload/raw/037750184f8b2a5ecfa7ed0403410e73061b1fa7/docs/assets/badges/compact/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></p><p>支援的 Minecraft 版本詳見檔案名稱中的版本資訊。<br>\n專為 Fabric、Quilt、Forge 和 NeoForge 模組載入器製作。<br>\n客戶端與伺服器端皆可使用。</p><h2>常見問題</h2><ul>\n<li><p>問：你會將此模組移植到較舊的 Minecraft 版本嗎？<br>\n答：不會。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>問：此模組能在多人模式下運作嗎？<br>\n答：可以。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>問：只有客戶端需要此模組，還是伺服器也需要？<br>\n答：只有客戶端需要此模組。</p>\n</li>\n</ul><h2>貢獻</h2><p>如果您遇到問題或想建議功能，請在問題追蹤器上<a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/blinkload/issues/new\" rel=\"nofollow\">建立問題</a>。</p><h3>開發</h3><ul>\n<li><code>git clone <a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/blinkload.git\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/blinkload.git</a></code></li>\n<li><code>cd blinkload</code></li>\n<li><code>./gradlew build</code></li>\n</ul><h2>授權</h2><p>此專案採用 LGPLv3 授權，詳見 <a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/blinkload/blob/1.20-1.20.1/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a>。</p>",
